  "abstract": "This submission aims to further optimize the global SOTA model (ID 501, score -0.026210) by tuning the `residual_scale` parameter of the `Input-Adaptive Residual` from `0.05` to `0.07`. This parameter directly controls the magnitude of the dynamic modulation applied by the residual gate. This experiment tests if a slightly larger adaptive modulation range can enhance performance. All other hyperparameters (including `learn_gamma=True`, `residual_hidden=32`, Fourier backbone, and Adam optimizer settings) are precisely matched to the SOTA.",
